t_panel.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-q3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-q3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vim editing for every typed freeform field[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editors[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editors: give the shared TypedInputForm a masked single-line vim editor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for secret fields and a multi-line vim editor for text-typed and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repeatable fields, and route each editor's vim mode display to a host [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]screen hook.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The GateInputPanel modal and its pure request model[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editors[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: add the pure per-option input request/collection model and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]GateInputPanel modal screen that renders it, with a tab/shift+tab focus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ring, live validity, drafts, and a submit that returns per-option [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]values.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Route every gate submission through the panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: make GateBranchControls open the panel when a selection needs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed input, delete the inline Inputs section and the inline feedback [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]box, and simplify the focus ring and submit-state bookkeeping in both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate modals.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Configurable panel keymaps and modal footers[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keys[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keys: add open_inputs, next_input, and previous_input to the gate keymap[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope, thread the effective keys into the panel and both gate-modal [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footers, and keep declared gate-action keys from stealing them.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Panel styling, option input badges, and visual snapshots[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chrome[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keys[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chrome: style the panel so field text does not wrap, badge every option [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that declares inputs, drop the dead inline-input styles, and rebaseline [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus extend the gate PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Document the panel and its keys[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keys[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: update the notifications gate-review and gate-inputs prose, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate keymap tables, and the gate remapping example to describe [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel-based collection.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-q3","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-q3.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7e58c8648119d24f6b6a44b1cd4ed322","started_at":"2026-08-18T19:41:11.792189+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable